  "colorDark": {
    "_comment": "Overrides only — every key not listed here keeps its light-mode value from `color` above. Ported from web/apps/sharm-divers-club-site/app/assets/css/main.css's `@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)` block, which shipped before this section existed here — WEGO-015 closed that gap so this canonical file actually reflects what ships, verified against the CSS by test/DesignTokens.spec.ts rather than generated from it.",
